    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">History</h2>The colors of all the chameleons have mysteriously disappeared and they have been plunged into sadness. Embark on an adventure through different regions to discover what has happened to the lost colors and recover them to bring your people back to life.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/5ae67bd229bccf69c61818bc46f8f3b4.poster.avif?t=1754578581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/5ae67bd229bccf69c61818bc46f8f3b4.webm?t=1754578581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/5ae67bd229bccf69c61818bc46f8f3b4.mp4?t=1754578581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Colors</h2>The main mechanic in Camae is changing colors<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/c2b240b002a0769e279c23b94417caf7.poster.avif?t=1754578581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/c2b240b002a0769e279c23b94417caf7.webm?t=1754578581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/c2b240b002a0769e279c23b94417caf7.mp4?t=1754578581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Each color gives Camae different abilities, use those abilities for puzzle solving, discover new areas, and fight enemies.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/bb46fe3606c38f7e1b9da364b459b999.poster.avif?t=1754578581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta