m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/bb46fe3606c38f7e1b9da364b459b999.webm?t=1754578581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922580/extras/bb46fe3606c38f7e1b9da364b459b999.mp4?t=1754578581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
